	(text "CONTROLBOARD LINK J2 (MEZZANINE), ESD U5 U6, TVS D4"
		(at 149.86 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4636133a-ab0e-4e3d-b6c5-26e88e34139d")
	)
	(text "CONTROLBOARD LINK J2 - Samtec LSHM-110-02.5 on the board's underside, mates ControlBoard2027 J9\n(same part, 5mm stack). The radio sits over the controlboard MCU, held by J2 and two M2 standoffs (H1/H2).\nOdd row (module-pad order, rev 2026-11-07): 1 CS, 3 MOSI, 7 SCK, 9 HANDSHAKE, 11 DATA_READY, 15 MISO, 19 EN; 5/13/17 GND.\nEven row: 2-14 GND, 16/18/20 +3V3_HOST. SH to GND. Pin p here mates controlboard pin p+1 (odd p) or p-1 (even p).\nESD in J2 pin order: U5 EN/MISO/DATA_READY, U6 HANDSHAKE/SCK/MOSI/CS. D4 3.3V TVS on +3V3_HOST.\nControlboard pull-ups/downs: CS pull-up (R29), HANDSHAKE/DATA_READY pull-downs (R31/R32).\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §5."
		(at 152.4 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "54efaecc-6d93-4633-b4a8-b6a54d6283ed")
	)
	(text "ROUTING - LINK\nJ2, U5, U6 on B.Cu, D4 on F.Cu over J2. Each line runs J2 pad -> ESD pad -> pass-through pad on L4, no via before the protector.\nMISO, DR, HS, SCK, MOSI: 0.15mm (50R) on L4 over the L3 GND region to one via in the pad band (GND via 0.635mm), short L1 stub into the pad.\nCS: one via west of pad 12. EN: via right after U5, L1 through R2 to pad 3. D4 inline on +3V3_HOST (one via from J2).\nSCK/MOSI/CS/MISO matched J2 pad to U1 pad within 0.001mm (14.08mm to the track end in the pad, 14.53mm pad centre to pad centre, DESIGN_NOTES §7)."
		(at 152.4 220.98 0)
		(effects
